Configure these repository Actions secrets before running
[the CI/CD workflow](./ci-cd.yaml):

- `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`: Docker Hub account name.
- `DOCKERHUB_TOKEN`: Docker Hub access token.
- `KUBECONFIG`: kubeconfig content for the deployment cluster.

The workflow builds the Docker images from `k8s/backend` and `k8s/frontend`,
pushes them to Docker Hub, and deploys the image-based Kubernetes workloads.
See the root [README](../README.md) for the other deployment scenarios.
